---
import BaseLayout from "../../layouts/BaseLayout.astro";

const siteUrl = "https://thebestaitoolsreview.com";
const pageUrl = siteUrl + "/templates/nda-template/";
const faqItems = [
  { q: "Is this NDA template legally binding?", a: "This is a template for reference and educational purposes. For legally binding agreements, consult a qualified attorney who can tailor the NDA to your specific jurisdiction and circumstances." },
  { q: "What is the difference between mutual and unilateral NDA?", a: "A unilateral NDA protects one party's confidential information. A mutual NDA protects both parties' information. Use mutual NDAs when both parties will share sensitive information." }
];
const faqSchema = { "@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"FAQPage","url":pageUrl,"mainEntity": faqItems.map(f => ({ "@type":"Question","name":f.q,"acceptedAnswer":{"@type":"Answer","text":f.a} })) };
const articleSchema = { "@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","headline":"Non-Disclosure Agreement (NDA) Template","description":"A comprehensive NDA template for protecting confidential information in business relationships. Covers mutual and unilateral agreements.","url":pageUrl,"author":{"@type":"Organization","name":"AI Tool Hub"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"AI Tool Hub"},"datePublished":"2026-07-26","dateModified":"2026-07-26" };
const breadcrumb = { "@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"BreadcrumbList","itemListElement":[{"@type":"ListItem","position":1,"name":"Home","item":siteUrl},{"@type":"ListItem","position":2,"name":"Templates","item":siteUrl+"/templates/"},{"@type":"ListItem","position":3,"name":"NDA Template","item":pageUrl}] };
---

<BaseLayout title="Non-Disclosure Agreement (NDA) Template | AI Tool Hub" description="A comprehensive NDA template for protecting confidential information." keywords="NDA template, non-disclosure agreement, confidentiality agreement, legal template" lang="en">
  <Fragment slot="head">
    <script type="application/ld+json" set:html={JSON.stringify(faqSchema)}></script>
    <script type="application/ld+json" set:html={JSON.stringify(articleSchema)}></script>
    <script type="application/ld+json" set:html={JSON.stringify(breadcrumb)}></script>
  </Fragment>
  <div class="article">
    <nav class="breadcrumbs"><a href="/">Home</a> &rsaquo; <a href="/templates/">Templates</a> &rsaquo; <span>NDA Template</span></nav>
    <header class="article-header">
      <span class="eyebrow">Free Template</span>
      <h1>Non-Disclosure Agreement (NDA) Template</h1>
      <p>A comprehensive NDA template for protecting confidential information. Suitable for freelancers, agencies, startups, and enterprise partnerships.</p>
    </header>
    <section class="article-body">

      <h2>Template</h2>
      <pre class="prompt-block"><code># NON-DISCLOSURE AGREEMENT

**This Agreement** is made on [Date] between:

**Disclosing Party:** [Company Name], [Address]
**Receiving Party:** [Company/Individual Name], [Address]

(Collectively "Parties")

---

## 1. PURPOSE
The Parties wish to explore a potential business relationship regarding [describe purpose]. In connection with this purpose, the Disclosing Party may disclose Confidential Information to the Receiving Party.

## 2. CONFIDENTIAL INFORMATION
"Confidential Information" means any information disclosed by the Disclosing Party to the Receiving Party, whether orally, in writing, or in any other form, that:
- Is marked or identified as "Confidential" at the time of disclosure
- Relates to [business plans, financial data, customer lists, trade secrets, technical specifications, source code]

## 3. EXCLUSIONS
Confidential Information does not include information that:
a) Is or becomes publicly available through no fault of the Receiving Party
b) Was rightfully in the Receiving Party's possession prior to disclosure
c) Is independently developed by the Receiving Party without use of Confidential Information
d) Is required to be disclosed by law or court order

## 4. OBLIGATIONS
The Receiving Party agrees to:
a) Use Confidential Information solely for the Purpose
b) Limit access to employees/contractors who need to know
c) Protect Confidential Information with at least reasonable care
d) Not copy, distribute, or reverse engineer Confidential Information
e) Return or destroy all Confidential Information upon written request

## 5. TERM
This Agreement shall remain in effect for [2/3/5] years from the date of signing.

## 6. NO LICENSE
Nothing in this Agreement grants any license, ownership, or rights to Confidential Information.

## 7. GOVERNING LAW
This Agreement shall be governed by the laws of [State/Country].

---

**IN WITNESS WHEREOF**, the Parties have executed this Agreement:

Disclosing Party: ____________________ Date: ________
Receiving Party:  ____________________ Date: ________

---

**Disclaimer:** This is a template for informational purposes only and does not constitute legal advice.</code></pre>

      <h2>FAQ</h2>
      <div class="card-grid">
        {faqItems.map(f => (
          <div class="info-card"><h3>{f.q}</h3><p>{f.a}</p></div>
        ))}
      </div>
      <p class="back-link"><a href="/templates/">All Templates</a></p>
    </section>
  </div>
</BaseLayout>
